### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@staffKey = dev-staff-key-change-me
@authToken = sess_sample_token

### 1.1 Register New Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arjun Mehta",
  "email": "arjun.demo@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

### 1.2 Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "arjun.demo@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1.3 Get Current Profile (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 1.4 Forgot Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "arjun.demo@example.com"
}

### 1.5 Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.1 Nearest Branches
GET {{baseUrl}}/branches/nearest?lat=12.9716&lng=77.5946&limit=3

### 2.2 Branch Directions
GET {{baseUrl}}/branches/1/directions?from_lat=12.9716&from_lng=77.5946

### 2.3 Delivery Quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/delivery/quote?lat=12.9716&lng=77.5946&amount_paise=120000

### 2.4 Geocode Address
POST {{baseUrl}}/geo/geocode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Indiranagar 100ft Road, Bengaluru"
}

### 3.1 Initialize Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/964c2a9d-12d2-4b07-98b0-09498cef7944/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.2 Verify Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/964c2a9d-12d2-4b07-98b0-09498cef7944/payment/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_mock_9a8b7c",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_mock_123456",
  "razorpay_signature": "mock_signature_hash"
}

### 3.3 Delivery Tracking (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/964c2a9d-12d2-4b07-98b0-09498cef7944/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3.4 Update Delivery Status (Staff)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/staff/deliveries/964c2a9d-12d2-4b07-98b0-09498cef7944/status
x-staff-key: {{staffKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY",
  "note": "Rider out on vehicle"
}

### 3.5 Complete Delivery with Handover Code (Staff)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/staff/deliveries/964c2a9d-12d2-4b07-98b0-09498cef7944/status
x-staff-key: {{staffKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DELIVERED",
  "handover_code": "1234",
  "note": "Delivered to recipient"
}

### 4.1 Chat - General FAQ
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "how fast is your delivery?"
}

### 4.2 Chat - Product Search
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "find monstera plants"
}

### 4.3 Chat - Human Escalation
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "I need to talk to a human agent"
}
